9. Publish ONLY if: all numeric gates pass AND the full-body renders are clearly closer to god_A than fullbody_i03_front.png (no shredded hems, continuous trim, sash not cutting through plates). Back up first: cp models/astra_character_v2.blend/.glb to models/astra_character_v2_pre_body.blend/.glb. Write renders/astra/char2/MESHY_BODY_REPORT.md (import findings, segmentation, fit, binding, all gates, move audit, SHA256s, publish decision, honest shortfalls).
