The move transfer is working and the first clip retained its action and sub-micron grip, but the new surface sits slightly lower than the old one: Idle Guard currently measures −1.552 mm sole and −0.400 mm cloth clearance. I’m letting all five audits finish first, then I’ll apply derived-only foot and distal-phys lifts to the new move files and rerun the gates.
